LabStock – Electronics Laboratory Component Availability Tracker

Problem Statement

Electronics students often waste valuable laboratory time searching for components because they don't know their availability, quantity, or storage location.

Objective

To develop a simple web application that helps students check the availability and storage location of electronic components.

Target Users

- ECE Students
- Laboratory Staff
- Faculty Members
- Project Teams

Planned Features

- Search for electronic components
- Check available quantities
- View component availability
- Find storage locations
- Admin can update component stock

Technologies

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- GitHub
